## Naming Conventions

| Entity | Pattern | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| ViewModel | `{Feature}ViewModel` | `GuidesViewModel` |
| Screen composable | `{Feature}Screen` | `GuidesScreen` |
| View composable | `{Feature}View` | `GuidesView` |
| Sub-views directory | `views/` | `guides/ui/views/` |
| Store interface | `{Feature}Store` | `GuidesStore` |
| Store Intent | `{Feature}Store.Intent` | `GuidesStore.Intent` |
| Store State | `{Feature}Store.State` | `GuidesStore.State` |
| Store Label | `{Feature}Store.Label` | `GuidesStore.Label` |
| UI state | `Ui{Feature}State` | `UiGuidesState` |
| UI label | `Ui{Feature}Label` | `UiGuidesLabel` |
| State mapper | `Ui{Feature}StateMapper` | `UiGuidesStateMapper` |
| Label mapper | `Ui{Feature}LabelMapper` | `UiGuidesLabelMapper` |
| Repository contract | `{Topic}Repository` | `GuidesRepository`, `ResourcesRepository` |
| REST client interface | `{Topic}ApiClient` | `GuidesApiClient`, `ConstantsApiClient` |
| REST client impl | `{Topic}ApiClientImpl` | `GuidesApiClientImpl`, `ConstantsApiClientImpl` |
| Mapper file | `{Topic}Mappers.kt` | `GuideMappers.kt` |
| Koin module fun | `{moduleName}Module` | `commonModule`, `coreNetworkModule`, `featureGuidesImplModule` |

## Existing Features

- `:shared:feature-guides:*` — list of high-rated builds for a hero. Data from the d2bh-backend REST proxy: `GET /v1/guides` for builds, `GET /v1/constants` for hero/item/ability metadata and icon URLs.

Navigation uses the `Screen` marker interface + `@Serializable` route objects (`GuidesRoute`) in `:shared:core-navigation`; per-feature `ScreenApi` extensions register composables on `NavGraphBuilder`. See `mobile-architecture.mdc`.
